@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- `gradebook report --sort grade` lists the highest percent first and students with no grade last; `--sort name` stays the default.
 - Score sheets have a `name` column after `student_id`, written as `Last, First`.
 - Courses that do not set `grade_decimals` now round final percents to two decimals instead of one.
 - Fixed: drop_lowest ranks scores by percent of possible points, so a 4/5 is no longer dropped ahead of a 6/10.
